        "complete_trace": "Parse full native header, all timed lines, all untimed continuations and exact typed identities/quantity/order. Reject unknown, duplicated, orphan, missing or post-horizon events, including repeated native ready diagnostics only at their declared positions. Parse original parent independently too.",
        "h6_required_order": [
            "task 0 OUT created from P-CREW BASE-01 quantity1",
            "P-CREW BASE-01 OUT demand/request quantity1",
            "task 0 OUT starts with1 and prints transfer time40",
            "one local physical and nominal decrement at their typed edges; no duplicate",
        ],
        "native_spacing": "Descriptions name typed tokens, not literal single-space raw lines; original native whitespace/trailing padding is SHA-sealed and accepted parser must bind values and line order.",
        "arrival_gate": "Exactly zero arrival/completion/cancellation events for task0 at or before h36. Any h10, h36 or other within-horizon linked arrival fails, as does a second OUT task, backorder, duplicate decrement or unlinked transfer.",
        "other_lifecycle": "Both mission waves, aircraft IDs, serial preparation, queue/book/using/free snapshots, h8.5/h20.5 launch, h9.5/h21.5 return, full diagnostics, and terminal h36 must match independently derived source/typed expectations; no broad raw prefix or file-byte equality shortcut.",
