        "future_runner": "Use neutral fixed-file SSH transport, exact stdout/stderr bytes, actual child PID/session0/integer OS exit, serial mutex until all children finish naturally, sshd ancestry and sole protected GUI PID13340/session1/startms1790590196826/responding/WTS active before/after each stage. No kill, timeout after connection, interruption, automatic retry, hidden approval inheritance or accepted parent rerun.",
        "future_six_stages": "Import/export/calc/report/roundtrip/behavior with exact program/argv/time/PID/session/status, converter errors0 and only predeclared diagnostics, source maps before/after, raw closure and failure seal. Exit0 alone is insufficient; any failed stage preserves complete original output and NO_GO.",
        "publication": "After native, separate independent raw/cell/content/staged/remote gates. No catalog append from author and no promotion of secondary v100 NO_GO.",
    },
    "source_lineage": {
        "base_commit": BASE,
        "accepted_primary_parent_index": {"path": PARENT_INDEX.relative_to(ROOT).as_posix(), **pfile(PARENT_INDEX)},
