                                 "future_archive_required": "Copy exact local 492-entry bytes into new owned package after contract GO; require archive and distinct base Git blob. Before native exact live byte match; after authorized append typed full metadata and first492 entries plus unique IDs, not arbitrary fallback or dropped check."},
